>
>
>
> I was very impressed with the difference in estimates between model functions! Should I be more confident with this model?
>
>
>
> Indeed we have some issues with data. I believe that the fact that we use a boat of minimum height (4.5m) and the observers looking a lot at the bow contributed to this spike in the detection function (I attached the new one).
